# Orion TV v3.0 — Complete Plan

## Executive Summary

Orion TV is a **Tizen Web Application** for Samsung Smart TVs that runs the full Orion cinema/media experience on a 10-foot (lean-back) display. It is controlled **exclusively** via **Orion Connect on Mobile**, which will be restructured into **Orion Hub** — the centralized command center for Desktop, TV, and future devices.

---

