## Proposed Changes

### Phase 13.1 — Orion Hub (Mobile Restructure)

The core Mobile restructure to support multi-device targeting. This is the foundation for everything else.

---

#### [MODIFY] [`useConnectController.ts`](file:///c:/Projects/Orion%20-%20A%20Multiverse%20of%20Stories/apps/mobile/src/features/connect/useConnectController.ts)

**Major refactor: Extract device-agnostic transport into a shared base, add device targeting.**

- Add a `targetDevice` concept: `{ type: 'desktop' | 'tv', instanceId, host, port, name }`
- Current Desktop-specific logic stays, but wrapped behind `targetDevice.type === 'desktop'` guards
- New `targetDevice.type === 'tv'` path shares 95% of the socket/pairing/command logic
- New state: `connectedDevices: Map<instanceId, DeviceConnection>` — Hub can be paired with multiple devices simultaneously
- Active control targets one device at a time (the `activeTarget`)

