### Phase 13.5 — Android TV Future-Proofing

The TV app is built as a **standard web app** (React + Vite). For Android TV deployment later:

- Android TV supports **WebView-based apps** via a thin Android shell (similar to Capacitor/Cordova)
- The same React codebase runs inside an Android WebView
- Or: we build a React Native for TV variant (using `react-native-tvos` / Android TV extensions)
- The Smart Connect server code is identical — just the packaging differs

> [!NOTE]
> No Android TV code is written in this phase. The architecture is designed so that when the time comes, we wrap the same `apps/tv/` web app in an Android WebView shell, or create `apps/tv-android/` as a thin native wrapper.

